# NaCl transverse-optical (T1u) zone-center phonon, from inelastic neutron
# scattering: Raunio, Almqvist & Stedman, "Phonon Dispersion Relations in
# NaCl", Phys. Rev. 178, 1496 (1969). Intensity is arbitrary (100 = the
